16 teams are competing in the league&nbsp;– the top 13 teams from the previous season and the 3 teams promoted from the [[2021–22 Saudi First Division League|FD League]].

'''Teams who were promoted to the Pro League'''

All 3 teams were promoted on the final day of the season. [[Khaleej FC|Al-Khaleej]] were promoted and crowned champions following a 0–0 away draw with [[Najran SC|Najran]].<ref>{{cite web |title=الخليج بطل دوري "يلو" |url=https://arriyadiyah.com/769721}}</ref> Al-Khaleej return to the top flight for the first time since getting relegated in the [[2016–17 Saudi Professional League|2016–17 season]]. Al-Khaleej will play in their 8th season in the top flight.

[[Al-Adalah FC|Al-Adalah]] were promoted following a 0–0 draw away to [[Jeddah Club|Jeddah]].<ref>{{cite web |title=دوري يلو.. صعود الخليج والعدالة والوحدة إلى المحترفين |url=https://arriyadiyah.com/769675}}</ref> Al-Adalah return to the top flight after an absence of two seasons. Al-Adalah will play in their 2nd season in the top flight.

[[Al-Wehda Club (Mecca)|Al-Wehda]] were promoted following a 3–0 away win against [[Al-Diriyah Club|Al-Diriyah]].<ref>{{cite web |title=صعود الخليج والعدالة والوحدة لدوري المحترفين والجيل والدرعية والكوكب والنهضة وبيشة إلى الثانية |url=https://www.al-jazirah.com/2022/20220529/sp9.htm}}</ref> Al-Wehda will play in the top flight of Saudi football after a season's absence. Al-Wehda will play in their 38th season in the top flight.

'''Teams who were relegated to the FD League'''

[[Al-Hazem F.C.|Al-Hazem]] were the first team to be relegated following a 5–2 defeat away to [[Ettifaq FC|Al-Ettifaq]] on 21 May.<ref>{{cite web |title=الاتفاق يتنفس الصعداء ويؤكد هبوط الحزم |url=https://lym.news/a/6397942}}</ref> Al-Hazem were relegated after just one year in the top flight. This was their second relegation in three years.

Both [[Al-Ahli Saudi FC|Al-Ahli]] and [[Al-Faisaly FC|Al-Faisaly]] were relegated following on the final day of the season. Al-Ahli were relegated for the first time in their history following a 0–0 away draw with [[Al-Shabab FC (Riyadh)|Al-Shabab]].<ref>{{cite web |title=الأهلي.. صدمة الهبوط |url=https://arriyadiyah.com/772859}}</ref> They have previously competed in every edition of the Saudi Pro League since its inception in 1976–77. This is the first edition of the Pro League in which Al-Ahli will not be featured.

Al-Faisaly were relegated following a 2–1 away defeat to [[Al Hilal SFC|Al-Hilal]].<ref>{{cite web |title=الفيصلي ينهي 12 عاما بين الكبار |url=https://arriyadiyah.com/772852}}</ref> Al-Faisaly were relegated after 12 consecutive seasons in the top flight.

